  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/m5JXNZi.png?1\" alt=\"\" width=\"457\" height=\"141\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p><strong>需要安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/continuity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Continuity</a> 模組才能運作！</strong></p><p>這個資源包讓所有礦石（煤炭除外）發出帶有清晰輪廓的光芒，使它們在挖礦時更容易被發現。專為搭配光影效果設計，光影常會使洞穴更暗，降低礦石的可見度。這個資源包透過提升對比度解決了這個問題，同時不破壞遊戲沉浸感。</p><p>除了發光效果，礦石還擁有清晰的連接邊框，提升可辨識度，幫助你更輕鬆地注意到礦脈。當礦石部分隱藏在岩漿中、方塊後方或其他難以看清的區域時，這個效果也能讓它們更突出。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/10XlIcD.png\" width=\"458\" height=\"258\"></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BRivw2D.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"412\" height=\"41\"></span></p><p>💡自發光紋理</p><p>🧩連接紋理</p><p>具備這些功能的方塊：</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xM3aJYu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;鑽石礦</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LFyKY9E.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;綠寶石礦</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kmuTe3Z.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;銅礦</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CNtIu0l.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;紅石礦</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Knfi1gx.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;青金石礦</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KABxb8o.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;金礦</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RvRYyBv.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;鐵礦</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cBxAhk6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;原生礦塊</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rdJq75Z.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;地獄礦石</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Y1yf1jb\" alt=\"\" width=\"Infinity\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Y1yf1jb.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"412\" height=\"41\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/letN_Cn2UDw?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span>Bearded Goof 的 YouTube 頻道：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCYshYfEfdDm-YTLP6QPLuXA\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCYshYfEfdDm-YTLP6QPLuXA</a></p>",
